      "titleEn": "Requirements Evaluation: RAG with Vector Search vs Fine-Tuning for Dynamic Policies",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 680 230\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <rect width=\"680\" height=\"230\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#334155\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/>\n  <text x=\"24\" y=\"24\" fill=\"#ff3621\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\">ARCHITECTURAL DECISION: DYNAMIC POLICIES AND LEGAL TRACEABILITY</text>\n  <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"656\" y2=\"34\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n\n  <!-- Left Card: Scenario Reqs -->\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"48\" width=\"190\" height=\"160\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\"/>\n  <rect x=\"34\" y=\"58\" width=\"170\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#0369a1\"/>\n  <text x=\"119\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Business Requirements</text>\n  <text x=\"34\" y=\"94\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Changes: Every 2 weeks</text>\n  <text x=\"34\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Audit: Verbatim citation required</text>\n  <text x=\"34\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Zero tolerance for hallucinations</text>\n  <rect x=\"34\" y=\"142\" width=\"170\" height=\"52\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#38bdf8\"/>\n  <text x=\"42\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#38bdf8\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\">Technical Verdict:</text>\n  <text x=\"42\" y=\"172\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"7.5\">Dynamic external knowledge</text>\n  <text x=\"42\" y=\"184\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"7.5\">incompatible with fixed weights</text>\n\n  <!-- Mid: Fine-Tuning Fail -->\n  <rect x=\"230\" y=\"48\" width=\"200\" height=\"160\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#ef4444\"/>\n  <rect x=\"240\" y=\"58\" width=\"180\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#991b1b\"/>\n  <text x=\"330\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Fine-Tuning with LoRA ❌</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"94\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Freezes data in neural weights</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Retrain every 14 days (high $$$)</text>\n  <text x=\"240\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#fca5a5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Prone to factual hallucinations</text>\n  <rect x=\"240\" y=\"142\" width=\"180\" height=\"52\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#450a0a\" stroke=\"#ef4444\"/>\n  <text x=\"248\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#f87171\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"700\">Critical Audit Failure:</text>\n  <text x=\"248\" y=\"172\" fill=\"#fecaca\" font-size=\"7.5\">Does not produce verbatim citations</text>\n  <text x=\"248\" y=\"184\" fill=\"#fecaca\" font-size=\"7.5\">verifiable before a judge</text>\n\n  <!-- Right: RAG Success -->\n  <rect x=\"446\" y=\"48\" width=\"210\" height=\"160\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <rect x=\"456\" y=\"58\" width=\"190\" height=\"20\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#064e3b\"/>\n  <text x=\"551\" y=\"72\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"8\" font-weight=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\">RAG with Vector Search ✓</text>\n  <text x=\"456\" y=\"94\" fill=\"#d1fae5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Continuous Delta Lake sync</text>\n  <text x=\"456\" y=\"110\" fill=\"#d1fae5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Exact citations (doc_id, page, clause)</text>\n  <text x=\"456\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#d1fae5\" font-size=\"7.5\">• Zero model retraining</text>\n  <rect x=\"456\" y=\"142\" width=\"190\" height=\"52\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#064e3b\" stroke=\"#10b981\"/>\n  <text x=\"464\" y=\"158\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"7.5\" font-weight=\"800\">Optimal Outcome:</text>\n  <text x=\"464\" y=\"172\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\" font-size=\"7.5\">100% traceable audit</text>\n  <text x=\"464\" y=\"184\" fill=\"#a7f3d0\" font-size=\"7.5\">Lowest cost and highest accuracy</text>\n</svg>",
      "caption": "En escenarios con normativas que cambian quincenalmente y exigencia de citas textuales legales, `RAG con Mosaic AI Vector Search` es la única solución válida: permite actualizar datos en Delta Lake sin reentrenar y aporta trazabilidad absoluta.",
      "captionEn": "In scenarios with bi-weekly regulatory updates and mandatory legal citations, `RAG with Mosaic AI Vector Search` is the only viable choice: it updates via Delta Lake without retraining and provides strict traceability."
